{"availability":"available","full":"orlandoc01/tallyo","name":"tallyo","description":"Self-hosted personal finance tracker for your household — transactions, budgets, net worth, and portfolio via Plaid, SimpleFIN, and crypto wallets. Rust + React PWA, single binary, SQLite.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":6,"forks":3,"created":"2026-08-22T06:34:47Z","updated":"2026-10-05T01:08:12Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://orlandoc01.github.io/tallyo/","topics":["budgeting","go","golang","graphql","mcp","net-worth","personal-finance","plaid","pwa","self-hosted","simplefin","sqlite"],"demo":"https://orlandoc01.github.io/tallyo/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:12.981Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:12.981Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T23:18:12.981Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T13:58:43.197Z","stars":6,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-10T23:18:12.981Z","stars":6,"forks":3}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Self-hosted personal finance tracker for your household. Supports Desktop and mobile PWA.","Live demo — the full UI running on fictional data in your browser (no backend, changes reset on reload)"],"features":["💰 All-in-one spending and net worth tracker — transactions, recurring charges, cash flow, budgets, investment portfolio, and historical net worth in one app","🏦 Bank integrations with Plaid and SimpleFIN — automatic transaction, balance, and holdings sync from thousands of institutions","📈 Yahoo Finance pricing and asset classification — live security quotes plus portfolio breakdowns by composition, Morningstar category/group, and sector","🪙 Crypto wallet tracking with DeBank — paste an EVM address to track token balances across chains; no API key required","🎯 Budget tracking — monthly budgets vs. actuals with history and copy-forward"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/orlandoc01/tallyo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"9e30f325ad6ebf2ebc0494